# The Lexique indexes are read as one string and searched by byte offset, and
# their SHA-256 hashes are recorded in vendor/lexique/SOURCE.md. core.autocrlf
# would rewrite them to CRLF on checkout, leaving a stray carriage return on
# every value and breaking both the hashes and the offsets. Keep them verbatim.
vendor/lexique/*.txt -text
vendor/wiktionary/*.txt -text
